    "html": "<section class=\"papel\" style=\"\"><h2 class=\"marker\" style=\"position:absolute;left:120px;top:100px;white-space:nowrap;font-size:84px;color:#111111;transform:rotate(-3deg);transform-origin:left center;\">Cómo optimizamos</h2><svg width=\"700\" height=\"36\" viewBox=\"0 0 700 36\" style=\"position:absolute;left:100px;top:204px;transform:rotate(-2deg);opacity:1;overflow:visible\"><defs><filter id=\"dv48\" x=\"-5%\" y=\"-40%\" width=\"110%\" height=\"180%\"><feTurbulence type=\"fractalNoise\" baseFrequency=\"0.035 0.55\" numOctaves=\"3\" seed=\"47\"/><feDisplacementMap in=\"SourceGraphic\" scale=\"16\"/></filter></defs><path d=\"M11 12 Q350 4 693 11 L687 28 Q315 32 5 26 Z\" fill=\"#D4FB04\" filter=\"url(#dv48)\"/></svg><div style=\"position:absolute;left:120px;top:300px;width:280px;height:280px;border-radius:999px;background:#D80036;color:#fff;padding:56px 30px;text-align:center\"><p style=\"font-family:Anton, Impact, sans-serif;font-size:56px;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1\">Medir</p><p style=\"font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:600;margin-top:14px\">Cada pieza, por serie, formato, hora y ciudad.</p></div><svg width=\"110\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 80\" style=\"position:absolute;left:370px;top:410px;transform:rotate(0deg);overflow:visible\"><path d=\"M6 58 C60 30 120 18 196 34\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#D4FB04\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M168 12 L200 34 L166 54\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#D4FB04\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><div style=\"position:absolute;left:450px;top:300px;width:280px;height:280px;border-radius:999px;background:#111111;color:#fff;padding:56px 30px;text-align:center\"><p style=\"font-family:Anton, Impact, sans-serif;font-size:56px;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1\">Aprender</p><p style=\"font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:600;margin-top:14px\">Un registro de aprendizajes que crece mes a mes.</p></div><svg width=\"110\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 80\" style=\"position:absolute;left:700px;top:410px;transform:rotate(0deg);overflow:visible\"><path d=\"M6 58 C60 30 120 18 196 34\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#D80036\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M168 12 L200 34 L166 54\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#D80036\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><div style=\"position:absolute;left:780px;top:300px;width:280px;height:280px;border-radius:999px;background:#D4FB04;color:#111111;padding:56px 30px;text-align:center\"><p style=\"font-family:Anton, Impact, sans-serif;font-size:56px;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1\">Probar</p><p style=\"font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:600;margin-top:14px\">Dos experimentos al mes: ganchos, duraciones, horarios o formatos.</p></div><svg width=\"110\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 80\" style=\"position:absolute;left:1030px;top:410px;transform:rotate(0deg);overflow:visible\"><path d=\"M6 58 C60 30 120 18 196 34\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#D80036\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M168 12 L200 34 L166 54\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#D80036\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><div style=\"position:absolute;left:1110px;top:300px;width:280px;height:280px;border-radius:999px;background:#111111;color:#fff;padding:56px 30px;text-align:center\"><p style=\"font-family:Anton, Impact, sans-serif;font-size:56px;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1\">Escalar</p><p style=\"font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:600;margin-top:14px\">Lo que gana se queda en el calendario; lo que no, sale.</p></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:120px;top:640px;width:1000px;height:300px;transform:rotate(-1deg);filter:drop-shadow(0 14px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.18))\"><div class=\"carta\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;padding:32px;background:#FBFAF7\"><p style=\"font-family:Anton, Impact, sans-serif;font-size:44px;line-height:1;text-transform:uppercase\">Objetivos orientativos a 12 meses</p><p style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:600;margin-top:12px\"><b style=\"color:#D80036\">Instagram:</b> De 147K a 180K seguidores en 12 meses</p><p style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:600;margin-top:12px\"><b style=\"color:#D80036\">TikTok:</b> Duplicar seguidores el primer año, con 5 vídeos por semana</p><p style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:600;margin-top:12px\"><b style=\"color:#D80036\">Deseo:</b> +25 % de guardados y compartidos por pieza frente a la línea base</p><p style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:600;margin-top:12px\"><b style=\"color:#D80036\">Club:</b> Altas mensuales al Club Devorador desde redes, medidas por código</p><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#5A5A5A;margin-top:12px\">Se fijan en firme con la línea base del primer mes.</p></div></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:1200px;top:640px;width:620px;height:300px;transform:rotate(1.5deg);filter:drop-shadow(0 14px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.18))\"><div class=\"carta\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;padding:32px;background:#FBFAF7\"><p style=\"font-family:'Permanent Marker', cursive;font-size:32px;line-height:1.1;color:#D80036\">Ejemplo de experimento</p><p style=\"font-size:21px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;margin-top:12px\">El Corte a las 13:30 frente a las 19:00, cuatro semanas. Si gana el mediodía por guardados, la serie cambia de hora en todo el calendario.</p></div></div><img src=\"/pitch/divorare/logo-llama.webp\" alt=\"Divorare\" style=\"position:absolute;left:1738px;top:40px;width:92px;height:auto;transform:rotate(6deg)\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:96px;top:1018px;width:1728px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(17,17,17,.55)\"><span>Maen Studios × Divorare</span><span>40</span></div></section>"
