    "id": "extras",
    "titulo": "Extras y condiciones",
    "html": "<section class=\"papel\" style=\"\"><h2 class=\"marker\" style=\"position:absolute;left:120px;top:100px;white-space:nowrap;font-size:84px;color:#111111;transform:rotate(-3deg);transform-origin:left center;\">Extras opcionales</h2><svg width=\"740\" height=\"36\" viewBox=\"0 0 740 36\" style=\"position:absolute;left:100px;top:204px;transform:rotate(-2deg);opacity:1;overflow:visible\"><defs><filter id=\"dv53\" x=\"-5%\" y=\"-40%\" width=\"110%\" height=\"180%\"><feTurbulence type=\"fractalNoise\" baseFrequency=\"0.035 0.55\" numOctaves=\"3\" seed=\"27\"/><feDisplacementMap in=\"SourceGraphic\" scale=\"16\"/></filter></defs><path d=\"M11 12 Q370 4 733 11 L727 28 Q333 32 5 26 Z\" fill=\"#D4FB04\" filter=\"url(#dv53)\"/></svg><div style=\"position:absolute;left:120px;top:300px;width:1080px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;border-bottom:3px dashed rgba(17,17,17,.25);padding-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:27px;font-weight:700\">Rodaje adicional en Madrid o Barcelona</span><span style=\"font-family:Anton, Impact, sans-serif;font-size:32px;color:#D80036;white-space:nowrap\">950 € / jornada</span></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:120px;top:392px;width:1080px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;border-bottom:3px dashed rgba(17,17,17,.25);padding-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:27px;font-weight:700\">Ruta de rodaje en otra ciudad</span><span style=\"font-family:Anton, Impact, sans-serif;font-size:32px;color:#D80036;white-space:nowrap\">1.400 € / jornada + desplazamiento</span></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:120px;top:484px;width:1080px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;border-bottom:3px dashed rgba(17,17,17,.25);padding-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:27px;font-weight:700\">Cobertura de apertura o evento</span><span style=\"font-family:Anton, Impact, sans-serif;font-size:32px;color:#D80036;white-space:nowrap\">950 € / evento</span></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:120px;top:576px;width:1080px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;border-bottom:3px dashed rgba(17,17,17,.25);padding-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:27px;font-weight:700\">Piezas UGC con creadores de Maen Talents</span><span style=\"font-family:Anton, Impact, sans-serif;font-size:32px;color:#D80036;white-space:nowrap\">desde 250 € / pieza</span></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:120px;top:668px;width:1080px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;border-bottom:3px dashed rgba(17,17,17,.25);padding-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:27px;font-weight:700\">Gestión de paid media en Meta y TikTok</span><span style=\"font-family:Anton, Impact, sans-serif;font-size:32px;color:#D80036;white-space:nowrap\">15 % de la inversión · mín. 750 € / mes</span></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:120px;top:760px;width:1080px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;border-bottom:3px dashed rgba(17,17,17,.25);padding-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:27px;font-weight:700\">Campaña de Navidad «El Gordo se devora»</span><span style=\"font-family:Anton, Impact, sans-serif;font-size:32px;color:#D80036;white-space:nowrap\">8.900 € (cerrado)</span></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:1300px;top:290px;width:520px;height:640px;transform:rotate(2deg);filter:drop-shadow(0 14px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.18))\"><div class=\"carta\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;padding:40px;background:#FBFAF7\"><p style=\"font-family:Anton, Impact, sans-serif;font-size:52px;line-height:1;text-transform:uppercase\">Condiciones</p><p style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:500;margin-top:18px;padding-left:30px;position:relative;color:#111111\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;color:#D80036;font-family:'Permanent Marker', cursive\">✕</span>Precios sin IVA, con facturación mensual por adelantado.</p><p style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:500;margin-top:18px;padding-left:30px;position:relative;color:#111111\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;color:#D80036;font-family:'Permanent Marker', cursive\">✕</span>Compromiso inicial de 6 meses; después, mes a mes.</p><p style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:500;margin-top:18px;padding-left:30px;position:relative;color:#111111\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;color:#D80036;font-family:'Permanent Marker', cursive\">✕</span>Dos rondas de cambios por pieza incluidas.</p><p style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:500;margin-top:18px;padding-left:30px;position:relative;color:#111111\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;color:#D80036;font-family:'Permanent Marker', cursive\">✕</span>El material en bruto y editado es vuestro.</p><p style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:500;margin-top:18px;padding-left:30px;position:relative;color:#111111\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;color:#D80036;font-family:'Permanent Marker', cursive\">✕</span>La inversión en publicidad, los fees de creadores, la imprenta y los premios van aparte.</p></div></div><img src=\"/pitch/divorare/logo-llama.webp\" alt=\"Divorare\" style=\"position:absolute;left:1738px;top:40px;width:92px;height:auto;transform:rotate(6deg)\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:96px;top:1018px;width:1728px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(17,17,17,.55)\"><span>Maen Studios × Divorare</span><span>44</span></div></section>"
